Copy `vaults.json.example` to `vaults.json` and replace the example paths with your own. `drive_folder_id` is optional; if omitted, Docs are created in the root of My Drive.

If you only want to sync one vault, you can simply delete the other entries.

```json
[
  {
    "name": "MyVault1",
    "main": "C:\\Path\\To\\Your\\Obsidian\\MyVault1",
    "drive_folder_id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID"
  },
  {
    "name": "MyVault2",
    "main": "C:\\Path\\To\\Your\\Obsidian\\MyVault2",
    "drive_folder_id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID"
  }
]
```